{"id":"vod_bf_21046","vodId":"21046","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠改 魔人布欧篇","name_cn":"龙珠改 魔人布欧篇","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-22/9315fd010ac50dca89e279d2f260c75f.jpg"},"summary":"经历了惊心动魄的沙鲁之战，Z战士更新换代。地球在孙悟饭（野泽雅子 配音）和朋友们的守护下，迎来了七年漫长而又短暂的和平岁月。已变成俊朗青年的每天往返于学校，在此期间结识了撒旦的女儿比迪丽。伴随着全世界的呐喊，阔别已久的天下第一武道大会宣布再度召开。悟饭、比迪丽、18号悟天、特兰克斯甚至从另一个世界告假而来的孙悟空等Z战士高调参加比赛，令坐享其成的撒旦战栗不已。而在赛场上，两名奇怪选手的加盟则拉开了地球新一轮危机的帷幕。在此之后，来自外太空的邪恶魔法师巴菲迪登场，他利用邪恶手段复活了被界王神封印的恐怖对手魔人布欧（盐屋浩三 配音）。Z战士的最恶之战，地球危在旦夕……　　本片系为纪念《龙珠Z》开播20周年而重新修复制作的动画作品。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动作,动画,奇幻,冒险,情,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 07:13:57","classic":true,"classicRank":41,"franchise":"龙珠","playable":true,"episodeCount":61,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaimorenbuoupian/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaimorenbuoupian/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaimorenbuoupian/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaimorenbuoupian/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaimorenbuoupian/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaimorenbuoupian/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaimorenbuoupian/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaimorenbuoupian/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaimorenbuoupian/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaimorenbuoupian/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaimorenbuoupian/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/longzhugaim